# changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html)

# [0.0.0] - 2026/07/29

- Added changelog.md
- nothng else

# [0.0.1] - 2026/08/02

- README fixed
- Fixed the bug of issue #6 (thanks for that report to gitduck6)

# [0.0.1] - 2026/08/03

- First stable release
- Added reason of use release to README

# [Unreleased] - 2026/08/06-07

- Kernel Allocator bug is fixed
- Left and Rigth memory block merge feature in kernel allocator
- [CRITIC] "end" var bug fixed in kernel
- [ADD] "added proc/tasks"

# [Unreleased] - 2026/08/12

*  Added
- Process Management: Implemented `proc_init`, `createp`, and `yield` for basic Round-Robin process scheduling (`src/proc/process.c`, `src/proc/process.h`)
- Context Switching
- Kernel Multitasking Test: Integrated `task_a` and `task_b` in `kernel.c` to test context switch shi

* Removed
- Removed legacy process files (`src/proc/task.c`, `src/proc/task.h`).

# [0.0.2] - 2026/08/17

* Added
- Issue #7: Implemented fundamental task representation in `src/proc/process.h` and `process.c`
- Added process states (`PROC_READY`, `PROC_RUNNING`, `PROC_SLEEPING`, `PROC_ZOMBIE`)
- Added x86_64 `struct context` matching `switch.s` registers
- Added `proc_exit` function to prevent kernel crash when task functions return
- Added `sleep_ticks`, `exit_code`, `name[16]` and `next` pointer to `proc struct`

* Changed
- Fixed state transitions in `yield()` (`PROC_RUNNING` <-> `PROC_RUNNABLE`)
